# Brand Guardrails

- Load `CONTEXT/brand.md` before editing briefs or scenarios.
- No unsubstantiated performance claims; flag regulated categories (finance, health).
- Tone must match brand voice defined in CONTEXT; reject off-brand slang.
- Logo/color references: cite asset IDs or paths, never invent hex without source.
- CTA copy: one primary CTA per asset unless MATRIX specifies A/B variants.
